1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,567
[JUNE] Why didn't you tell me?

2
00:00:03,567 --> 00:00:07,067
Your father never treated you
as if you're adopted, did he?

3
00:00:09,533 --> 00:00:11,467
Who's my real father?

4
00:00:13,033 --> 00:00:14,133
He's gone.

5
00:00:14,533 --> 00:00:16,233
He never came back.

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,067
He could be dead already.

7
00:00:18,467 --> 00:00:20,200
That's why ever since then,

8
00:00:20,733 --> 00:00:24,200
your father raised you
as his own.

9
00:00:24,633 --> 00:00:27,267
You know, sweetie,
if he were still alive,

10
00:00:27,533 --> 00:00:31,000
he wil fight for your rights
personally himself.

11
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:34,267
Because he's still a part
of Don Nato's family.

12
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:36,067
No matter how distant.

13
00:00:36,333 --> 00:00:38,400
But Ima, it's about
my personality.

14
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:41,367
I wish you had given me
a choice.

15
00:00:42,367 --> 00:00:45,000
Now I look like a liar
and a fool.

16
00:00:45,533 --> 00:00:47,600
My dear, you are not a liar.

17
00:00:48,167 --> 00:00:49,500
I am.

18
00:00:50,167 --> 00:00:53,133
[IMA] I was the one who kept
the truth from them.

19
00:00:53,133 --> 00:00:54,133
[IMA SNIFFLES]

20
00:00:54,133 --> 00:00:56,500
It just really pains me

21
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:58,667
to see you suffer

22
00:00:59,733 --> 00:01:01,633
just to keep us alive. [CRYING]

23
00:01:03,633 --> 00:01:06,300
That's why when I saw Attorney,

24
00:01:06,633 --> 00:01:08,033
I thought...

25
00:01:08,367 --> 00:01:10,200
that this is your chance

26
00:01:10,467 --> 00:01:12,667
for you to live a life

27
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:17,067
that I'll never be able
to provide.

28
00:01:20,167 --> 00:01:21,567
I'm sorry, sweetie.

29
00:01:21,833 --> 00:01:22,833
[SOBS]

30
00:01:22,833 --> 00:01:29,500
[MELANCHOLIC MUSIC PLAYING]

31
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:31,567
[PING]<i> If only I could take
</i> all your pain away, June.

32
00:01:33,133 --> 00:01:34,800
<i>But I think now's not the time.</i>

33
00:01:38,100 --> 00:01:39,067
[SOBS]

34
00:01:39,067 --> 00:01:40,267
Papa Ping?

35
00:01:41,333 --> 00:01:43,200
[JUNE SOBBING]

36
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,400
Papa Ping?!

37
00:01:51,633 --> 00:01:53,567
Ima, why didn't he go in?

38
00:01:54,433 --> 00:01:56,533
Only he could answer that.

39
00:01:58,733 --> 00:02:00,267
Ima, what if... [SNIFFLES]

40
00:02:00,267 --> 00:02:03,233
what if he believes
that I'm a scammer?

41
00:02:04,100 --> 00:02:06,367
What if he doesn't trust me
anymore?

42
00:02:07,700 --> 00:02:09,633
Ima, he's already been through
a lot.

43
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:13,833
[SOBS] Ima...

44
00:02:13,867 --> 00:02:20,867
[SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING]
